<title>GREECE: CITIBANK SETS NEW CITIGOLD CENTRE IN PIRAEUS BRANCH.</title>
<headline>CITIBANK SETS NEW CITIGOLD CENTRE IN PIRAEUS BRANCH.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank has established a new CitiGold centre for high-profile clients in its branch at Piraeus at Akti Miaouli 47-49, it said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>CitiGold clients receive the services of a CitiGold executive and alternative investment ideas in Greece and abroad. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
